<title>HUNGARY: SOCCER-MTK BEATS BVSC, WINS HUNGARY CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MTK BEATS BVSC, WINS HUNGARY CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Hungarian soccer cup final second leg played Wednesday night:</p>
<p>    MTK 2	   BVSC 0</p>
<p>MTK won the cup with an aggregated 8:0 after it won the first leg 6:0.</p>
<p>Scorers: Ferenc Orosz minutes 57, 72. Attendeance: 3,000</p>
